│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ cross                                                                                     │
│ patch_name               │ hybrid_chain_regularized                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ This crossover retains the individually parameterized RY layer and expressive per-wire    │
│                          │ pre-entanglement RZ rotations from the higher-validation chain architecture. It combines  │
│                          │ them with parity-shared post-entanglement RZ parameters from the current program to       │
│                          │ regularize the circuit and reduce parameter count. The open CZ chain removes the costly   │
│                          │ ring-closing gate, lowering depth and gate count while preserving connectivity across all │
│                          │ eight qubits. This balances validation accuracy, convergence speed, and generalization    │
│                          │ more effectively than either fully shared or fully independent RZ layers.                 │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
