│ patch_description        │ The current ansatz uses 18 independent parameters per block: eight RY angles, eight       │
│                          │ pre-entanglement RZ angles, and two shared post-RZ angles. The revision retains the same  │
│                          │ 18-parameter budget but changes where sharing occurs: pre-RZ angles are shared by         │
│                          │ even/odd wire parity for regularization, while post-RZ angles become wire-specific to     │
│                          │ preserve readout flexibility. Four parameter-free long-range CZ chords connect opposite   │
│                          │ qubits [0,4], [1,5], [2,6], and [3,7], complementing the local chain and enabling global  │
│                          │ correlations without increasing the trainable parameter count. The fixed external         │
│                          │ learning rate, iteration count, convergence threshold, loss weights, and selection        │
│                          │ criteria remain unchanged.                                                                │
