│ patch_description        │ This crossover keeps the higher-performing nearest-neighbor CZ chain from the inspiration │
│                          │ program while adopting the current program’s lower parameter count. Because RZ gates      │
│                          │ commute with CZ gates, the inspiration program’s parity-shared pre-RZ layer and           │
│                          │ independent post-RZ layer can be represented by one independent RZ layer without reducing │
│                          │ the block’s effective single-qubit phase expressivity. This removes redundant gates and   │
│                          │ parameters, reducing circuit depth and optimization overhead while preserving the         │
│                          │ productive RY-plus-CZ-chain structure.                                                    │
