                         Patch Metadata - Gen 34/80 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 1/2                         
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ merge_adjacent_rz_layers                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ Remove the second pre-entanglement RZ layer because it is directly adjacent to the first  │
│                          │ post-entanglement RZ layer. On each wire, consecutive RZ gates commute and collapse into  │
│                          │ a single RZ whose angle is their sum, so the removed parameters add no functional         │
│                          │ expressivity. This eliminates two independent parameters per repeated block and eight     │
│                          │ gates per block, reducing depth, optimization redundancy, and overfitting risk while      │
