│ patch_description        │ This ansatz replaces rigid pair-grouped preprocessing with parity-shared phase            │
│                          │ regularization and augments every chain interaction with a trainable controlled-Z         │
│                          │ rotation. The CRZ angles are shared across alternating edges, allowing the circuit to     │
│                          │ tune pairwise correlation strength with only two additional block parameters. This        │
│                          │ preserves independent local RY and post-entanglement phase adaptation while reducing the  │
│                          │ overfitting risk associated with excessive edge-specific parameters.                      │
