│                          │ layers, so this aligns the input layer with the circuit’s translational/parity structure. │
│                          │ It should substantially reduce the total parameter count and overfitting pressure while   │
│                          │ preserving distinct transformations for even and odd qubits, potentially narrowing the    │
│                          │ 0.08 generalization gap and improving convergence and parameter efficiency.               │
